OL,3,GNEWSADentist who defrauded NHS of
OL,4,A#92,500 jailed in absence
OL,5,
OL,6,FA dentist who defrauded the NHS of more
OL,7,Fthan #92,500 has been given a
OL,8,Fthree-year jail sentence.
OL,10,FDr Fariba Shameli, 55, who ran a
OL,11,Fsurgery in Worthing, West Sussex,
OL,12,Fsubmitted 1,037 fraudulent claims for
OL,13,Fwork between 2013 and 2018, the Crown
OL,14,FProsecution Service (CPS) said.
OL,16,FShameli, who is living in Sweden, was
OL,17,Fsentenced in her absence at Lewes Crown
OL,18,FCourt earlier, after being convicted of
OL,19,Ffour counts of fraud following two
OL,20,Ftrials.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
