OL,3,GNEWSADentist who defrauded NHS of
OL,4,A#92,500 jailed in absence
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe judge said Shameli showed a "lack
OL,7,Fof honesty", while the CPS said it
OL,8,Fwould try to recover the money and seek
OL,9,Fher extradition.
